{"title":"stream_security","url":"https://www.stream.security/blog","favicon":"https://www.stream.security/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"php2shell: stop patching in a panic, block what the attacker does next","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6ad9e3b21117c4a407fe952c_cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6ad9e3b21117c4a407fe952c_cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6ad9e3b21117c4a407fe952c_cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6ad9e3b21117c4a407fe952c_cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6ad9e3b21117c4a407fe952c_cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Threat Research</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AIDR</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-0\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226ad9dbf9b4fae5bf0ba9a513%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/php2shell-stop-patching-in-a-panic-block-what-the-attacker-does-next\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">php2shell: stop patching in a panic, block what the attacker does next</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">php2shell (CVE-2026-109618/CVE-2026-109619) is a memory-corruption RCE in PHP. Blocking what a compromised worker can do next matters more than racing to patch.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs w-condition-invisible\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Oct 22, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div class=\"w-dyn-bind-empty\"></div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/php2shell-stop-patching-in-a-panic-block-what-the-attacker-does-next","retrieved":1792627200000},{"title":"The Ransomware Finished. It Took Luck to Undo It.","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6abbcaaa11c5b6d49718c679_cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6abbcaaa11c5b6d49718c679_cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6abbcaaa11c5b6d49718c679_cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6abbcaaa11c5b6d49718c679_cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6abbcaaa11c5b6d49718c679_cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Agentic SOC</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AI SOC</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-1\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226abbbf91e0edbf70f82a3b3c%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/the-ransomware-finished-it-took-luck-to-undo-it\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">The Ransomware Finished. It Took Luck to Undo It.</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">It was a Saturday when a friend called. His company had been hit, a ransom demanded, could I help. I walked into an incident that looked already over: every VM…</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs w-condition-invisible\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Sep 29, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div class=\"w-dyn-bind-empty\"></div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/the-ransomware-finished-it-took-luck-to-undo-it","retrieved":1790640000000},{"title":"Your Tools. Your Cloud. Your Agents. Meet Custom Plugins for StreamForce","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a73200d2f0951e0f228e454_plugin-cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a73200d2f0951e0f228e454_plugin-cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a73200d2f0951e0f228e454_plugin-cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a73200d2f0951e0f228e454_plugin-cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a73200d2f0951e0f228e454_plugin-cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Product</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-3\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a731ed96354046d2c6834d9%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/your-tools-your-cloud-your-agents-meet-custom-plugins-for-streamforce\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">Your Tools. Your Cloud. Your Agents. Meet Custom Plugins for StreamForce</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">Customer-hosted plugins let you extend AI security agents with custom tools running in your own cloud. Securely connect agents to your code, infrastructure, and internal systems to validate vulnerabilities, investigate threats, and automate organization-specific security workflows, without exposing secrets outside your environment.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Dima Baraz\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a731cf05793a3017df7746a_Dima-web.png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a731cf05793a3017df7746a_Dima-web-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a731cf05793a3017df7746a_Dima-web.png 605w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Dima Baraz</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Aug 5, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div>2</div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/your-tools-your-cloud-your-agents-meet-custom-plugins-for-streamforce","retrieved":1785888000000},{"title":"The AI SOC Stopped the Attack. A Human Decided It Could.","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a69dbe2674a7479f14c4a79_4-cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a69dbe2674a7479f14c4a79_4-cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a69dbe2674a7479f14c4a79_4-cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a69dbe2674a7479f14c4a79_4-cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a69dbe2674a7479f14c4a79_4-cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Agentic SOC</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AI SOC</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-4\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a69d3a3771f83eaec322e9a%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/the-ai-soc-stopped-the-attack-a-human-decided-it-could\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">The AI SOC Stopped the Attack. A Human Decided It Could.</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">In a live run of the Part 2 attack, Stream.Security's AI SOC detected the compromised key, reconstructed the full attack chain including a hidden persistence backdoor, and deleted the stolen credential on its own, stopping the attack in about ten minutes with no human in the loop. Part 4 of the Building the Agentic SOC series is about the decision that made that safe: which response actions a human lets an AI agent take autonomously, and why that call belongs to the Security Architect.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Jul 29, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div>8</div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/the-ai-soc-stopped-the-attack-a-human-decided-it-could","retrieved":1785283200000},{"title":"One Case, Not a Swarm: Organizing the AI SOC","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6875977f6cc1eaeb68b226_once%20case%20cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6875977f6cc1eaeb68b226_once%20case%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6875977f6cc1eaeb68b226_once%20case%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6875977f6cc1eaeb68b226_once%20case%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6875977f6cc1eaeb68b226_once%20case%20cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Agentic SOC</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AI SOC</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-5\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a68738efe5b39ccd0bc6f92%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/one-case-not-a-swarm-organizing-the-ai-soc\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">One Case, Not a Swarm: Organizing the AI SOC</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">One attack in Part 2 threw off four separate alerts, and the obvious fix, one investigation agent per alert, rebuilds every failure of the overloaded human SOC at machine speed and cost. Part 3 of the Building the Agentic SOC series lays out the alternative: every related alert attaches to one linked case, worked by a small set of specialized agents, a dispatcher and case leader, over one shared model of the case and the environment.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Jul 28, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div>10</div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/one-case-not-a-swarm-organizing-the-ai-soc","retrieved":1785196800000},{"title":"Twenty-Five Minutes: One Leaked Key to Account Takeover","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a687089bb820aaa693994d4_25min%20cover.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a687089bb820aaa693994d4_25min%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a687089bb820aaa693994d4_25min%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a687089bb820aaa693994d4_25min%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a687089bb820aaa693994d4_25min%20cover.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Agentic SOC</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AI SOC</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AWS</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-6\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a686ed49f602545a6dfaf7d%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/twenty-five-minutes-one-leaked-key-to-account-takeover\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">Twenty-Five Minutes: One Leaked Key to Account Takeover</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">An AI agent given a single leaked AWS key escalated from a low-privileged Lambda user to full account takeover in under 25 minutes, wrong turns included. Part 2 of the Building the Agentic SOC series walks through the attack step by step, from credential theft to a brute-forced admin identity, to show exactly what the agentic SOC has to detect and stop.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Jul 28, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div>6</div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/twenty-five-minutes-one-leaked-key-to-account-takeover","retrieved":1785196800000},{"title":"The Security Architect's Next Deliverable: An Agentic SOC","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1.png 1200w\" class=\"post-image\"><div class=\"post-content-div\"><div class=\"div-block-992\"><div class=\"div-block-1010\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\" class=\"blog-category\">Agentic SOC</div><div class=\"highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible\">Popular</div><div class=\"highlight-tag w-condition-invisible\">Highlights</div><div class=\"hide w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">AI SOC</div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div fs-list-field=\"Topic\">Autonomous Production Defense</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-7\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a673db3e734bcf23a630f83%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/post/the-security-architects-next-deliverable-an-agentic-soc\" class=\"b-title w-inline-block\"><h2 fs-list-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-29 blog\">The Security Architect's Next Deliverable: An Agentic SOC</h2><div class=\"blog-par limit-char\">Security Architects are measured on how well they design defense, almost never on how well the SOC can respond to what that design misses. As AI turns the SOC from an organization into a system of agents, closing that gap becomes an architecture problem, and the Security Architect is the only one positioned to own it. Part 1 of a series building an agentic SOC hands-on with the open-source CDRGoat project.</div></a></div><div class=\"divider-full space small\"></div><div class=\"div-block-773\"><div class=\"writer-small dark\"><img height=\"70\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Petr Zuzanov\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png\" sizes=\"70px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w\" class=\"writer-image-small\"><div><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"writer---blog-page-home\">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class=\"div-block-790 xs\"><div class=\"div-block-953\"><div class=\"writer---blog-page-home date\">Jul 27, 2026</div></div><div class=\"code-embed-3 w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_2629_8)\">\n<path d=\"M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z\" stroke=\"#92A1B1\" stroke-width=\"0.857143\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"clip0_2629_8\">\n<rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"white\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg></div><div>6</div><div>min</div></div></div></div>","link":"https://www.stream.security/post/the-security-architects-next-deliverable-an-agentic-soc","retrieved":1785110400000}]}